{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/7b61f00edfb55ebcce82b2e7dfbaf461.webp?t=1750345655\" width=250 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just want to get to your room, but something isn't right about this hotel. The hallway stretches on forever. The doors repeat. The lighting feels off. Something watches from the corner of your eye. In <i>Room 808</i>, nothing is quite as it seems. Your goal is simple: reach your room. The challenge? Spotting the anomalies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/031c5a7ebf49a7253ec0a9c96d56761c.poster.avif?t=1750345655\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/031c5a7ebf49a7253ec0a9c96d56761c.webm?t=1750345655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/031c5a7ebf49a7253ec0a9c96d56761c.mp4?t=1750345655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/b174a054a69b0b3f5e21ba57bf922167.webp?t=1750345655\" width=250 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are subtle or surreal changes in the environment that signal something is wrong. They can range from distorted figures to altered lighting or sounds. Stay alert and spot anything out of place while navigating the hotel corridor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/f2dc9a75062f2c3f361787e58ae4e1cb.poster.avif?t=1750345655\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/f2dc9a75062f2c3f361787e58ae4e1cb.webm?t=1750345655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/f2dc9a75062f2c3f361787e58ae4e1cb.mp4?t=1750345655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/4a626dd706f2c919dad8238848c13bf0.webp?t=1750345655\" width=250 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot anomalies and choose the right elevator to take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares. As long as you're paying attention...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallway is small but the anomalies are numerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and examine every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach floor 8 and go to your room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Begin the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3641740/150881a11e54d3fe3aecff510db55b07c63458b2.jpg"},{"name":"Reach floor 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3641740/150881a11e54d3fe3aecff510db55b07c63458b2.jpg"},{"name":"Reach floor 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3641740/150881a11e54d3fe3aecff510db55b07c63458b2.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641740?t=1750345655","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/6e308cba4d1f2f3153c2587e41a019689083913f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750345655","capsule_image":"https://s